_WelcomeLabel2=This will install OpenKtooviot {#BUILD_GIT_VERSION_STRING} on your computer.%n%nOpenKtooviot is a modified version of Aegisub with Hebrew and right-to-left support and a built-in AI agent. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by the Aegisub developers.%n%nLike Aegisub, it is covered by the GNU General Public License version 2. This means you may use the application for any purpose without charge, but that no warranties of any kind are given either.%n%nThe source code is available at github.com/BanjoKazooie12/OpenKtooviot.
